<title>GERMANY: ATHLETICS-EL GUERROUJ BREAKS 1,500 INDOOR WORLD RECORD.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-EL GUERROUJ BREAKS 1,500 INDOOR WORLD RECORD.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Hicham El Guerrouj set a 1,500 metres indoor world record of three minutes 31.18 seconds at a international meeting on Sunday.</p>
<p>Guerrouj broke the previous best mark of 3:34.16 set by Noureddine Morceli of Algeria in Seville, Spain in 1991.</p>
